 = machine-site text (Line 5-Weinheim). It is the hidden join key of every fact table. Decision open." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="816" width="600" height="95" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1c48" value="&lt;b&gt;SIH source: &lt;/b&gt;GET /api/oee/v3/assets -&amp;gt; assetId" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#26C6B8;strokeColor=#00897B;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;strokeWidth=3;fillOpacity=30;fontColor=#00574B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="710" y="881" width="580" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1c49" value="&lt;b&gt;Columns added from Insights Hub that the report does not have&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="925" width="1260" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1c50" value="loaded_at (Datetime, 100% filled)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#eeeeee;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=10.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="951" width="1260" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="2 Plan OPT EU" id="page2"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="p2c2" value="&lt;b&gt;Plan OPT EU  -&amp;gt;  pbi_plan_opt&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontSize=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1500" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c3" value="Holds: Actual production per machine, plus capacity and monthly targets. One row is: Machine x date x shift x product.&lt;br&gt;Insights Hub table: 178 rows, 19 columns. One row per production day, machine, shift and product. Dates are text yyyy-mm-dd in the Insights Hub files (parquet has no date type).&lt;br&gt;Used on pages: EU-Level Overview, Site-Level Overview, Planned Losses, Unplanned Losses (some through measures)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="62" width="1260" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c4" value="&lt;b&gt;Power BI column&lt;/b&gt; (blue) and example (below it)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="172" width="270" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c5" value="&lt;b&gt;Insights Hub column&lt;/b&gt; and example (below it)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="172" width="270" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c6" value="&lt;b&gt;SIH integration&lt;/b&gt; (status and difference). Dashed box = SIH source: teal API endpoint, indigo built in the flow, grey none" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontSize=10.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="172" width="600" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c7" value="&lt;b&gt;Date&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;dateTime&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="200" width="280" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c8" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;e.g. 45678 (2025-01-21)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=1;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="242" width="280" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c9" value="&lt;b&gt;date&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;String, 100% filled&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="200" width="280" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c10" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;e.g. 2026-10-01 | 2026-10-02&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=1;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="242" width="280" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c11" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#d79b00;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p2c7" target="p2c9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c12" value="&lt;b&gt;ASSUMPTION&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Production day 06:00 to 06:00 UTC. Power BI local copy: calendar date. Not crucial: a window setting plus a backfill." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="200" width="600" height="109" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c13" value="&lt;b&gt;SIH source: &lt;/b&gt;No endpoint: the production day (06:00 to 06:00 UTC) is set in the flow. Hours come from POST /api/oee/v3/expressions/evaluateKPIs" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#7986CB;strokeColor=#3949AB;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;strokeWidth=3;fillOpacity=30;fontColor=#1A237E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="710" y="265" width="580" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c14" value="&lt;b&gt;AreaName&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;string&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="317" width="280" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c15" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;e.g. Tablets&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=1;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="359" width="280" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c16" value="&lt;b&gt;area_name&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;String, 100% filled&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="317" width="280" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c17" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;e.g. Bottles | Blisters&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=1;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="359" width="280" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c18" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#d79b00;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p2c14" target="p2c16"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c19" value="&lt;b&gt;ASSUMPTION&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Insights Hub area names. The Power BI local copy has its own. Accepted." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="317" width="600" height="94" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c20" value="&lt;b&gt;SIH source: &lt;/b&gt;GET /api/assetmanagement/v3/assets/{assetId} -&amp;gt; hierarchyPath, area level" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#26C6B8;strokeColor=#00897B;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;strokeWidth=3;fillOpacity=30;fontColor=#00574B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="710" y="367" width="580" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c21" value="&lt;b&gt;MachineName&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;string&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="419" width="280" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c22" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;e.g. Line 5&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=1;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="461" width="280" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c23" value="&lt;b&gt;machine_name&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;String, 100% filled&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="419" width="280" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c24" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;e.g. B2 Line | GT4&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=1;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="461" width="280" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c25" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#82b366;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p2c21" target="p2c23"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c26" value="&lt;b&gt;OK&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Direct. As Machine Names EU." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="419" width="600" height="82" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c27" value="&lt;b&gt;SIH source: &lt;/b&gt;GET /api/assetmanagement/v3/assets/{assetId} -&amp;gt; asset name" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#26C6B8;strokeColor=#00897B;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;strokeWidth=3;fillOpacity=30;fontColor=#00574B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="710" y="471" width="580" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c28" value="&lt;b&gt;ShiftName&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;string&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="509" width="280" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c29" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;e.g. Day&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=1;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="551" width="280" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c30" value="&lt;b&gt;shift_name&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;String, 100% filled&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="509" width="280" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c31" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;e.g. Shift 2 | Shift 1&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=1;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="551" width="280" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c32" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#d79b00;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p2c28" target="p2c30"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c33" value="&lt;b&gt;ASSUMPTION&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The report keeps the mapped Shift value (Afternoon, Blue, Day, Gold, Green, Night, Red), not the raw Provideam name. Insights Hub calendar names Blue, Gold, Green, Red match; Yellow, Shift 1 and Shift 2 do not (mapping needed). See the sheet Explanation Shift names." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="509" width="600" height="124" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c34" value="&lt;b&gt;SIH source: &lt;/b&gt;GET /api/oee/v3/calendars/{calendarId}/calendarEvents -&amp;gt; event name and recurrence. The calendarId comes from GET /api/oee/v3/assets/{assetId}/config" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#26C6B8;strokeColor=#00897B;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;strokeWidth=3;fillOpacity=30;fontColor=#00574B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="710" y="589" width="580" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c35" value="&lt;b&gt;PartName&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;string&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="641" width="280" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c36" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;e.g. SDENT,GB,GONZALES,12X30 TABS&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=1;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="683" width="280" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c37" value="&lt;b&gt;part_name&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;String, 83.1% filled&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="641" width="280" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c38" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;e.g. 250 mg tablets - Pep 8's | Dada/Straw 24's&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=1;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="683" width="280" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c39" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#d79b00;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p2c35" target="p2c37"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c40" value="&lt;b&gt;ASSUMPTION + PARTLY FILLED 83%&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Product description, else name. Empty where no product was found for the day. Format List (Hull) check: GT4 13 of 13 names match, B2 Line 0 of 27 (SAP-style descriptions against short Provideam names). See the sheet Explanation Format List." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="641" width="600" height="124" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c41" value="&lt;b&gt;SIH source: &lt;/b&gt;GET /api/oee/v3/assets/{assetId}/filterValues -&amp;gt; product names, then GET /api/oee/v3/productCollections/{collectionId}/products -&amp;gt; description" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#26C6B8;strokeColor=#00897B;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;strokeWidth=3;fillOpacity=30;fontColor=#00574B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="710" y="721" width="580" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c42" value="&lt;b&gt;Good Parts&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;int64, used on 2 pages&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="773" width="280" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c43" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;e.g. 30240&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=1;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="815" width="280" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c44" value="&lt;b&gt;good_parts&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;Float64, 100% filled&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="773" width="280" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c45" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;e.g. 0.0 | 70667.0&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=1;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="815" width="280" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c46" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#82b366;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p2c42" target="p2c44"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2c47" value="&lt;b&gt;OK&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Decimal (manual GT4 entries are spread over hours). Power BI local copy: whole numbers." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="773" width="600" height="94" as="geometry"/></mxCe